expect the world to change in the future from what our workload needs are,
关于我们工作负载需求所预示的未来世界将如何变化，

400
00:38:04,500 --> 00:38:12,720
what our models are, and how quickly your team responds in turning those insights into better chips, better systems, better software.
我们的模型是什么，以及你们团队如何迅速将这些洞察转化为更好的芯片、更好的系统、更好的软件。

