00:38:13,100 --> 00:38:22,640
So that's what worked really well with MI400 and left shifted a lot of the engineering work that we needed to do to bring this up online quickly.
这正是 MI400 项目之所以非常成功的原因，也让我们能将大量工程工作前置，快速将系统上线。

