And so really looking forward to accelerating that with MI500 and beyond and increasingly using AI to actually do that work for us rather than being limited by humans.
因此，我们非常期待通过 MI500 及后续产品进一步加速这一进程，并越来越多地利用 AI 来实际完成这些工作，而不是受限于人力。

