01:19:16,680 --> 01:19:24,620
So can you tell the team a little bit here today as to how your team actually develops GPU software and how have technologies like Triton evolved?
那么今天你能向团队简单介绍一下你们团队是如何开发 GPU 软件的，以及像 Triton 这样的技术是如何演进的吗？

889
01:19:25,080 --> 01:19:25,520
For sure.
当然可以。

890
01:19:25,520 --> 01:19:27,380
Well, first of all, thanks so much for having me.
首先，非常感谢邀请我。

891
01:19:27,920 --> 01:19:29,000
I was here two years ago.
我两年前来过这里。

892
01:19:29,080 --> 01:19:30,840
It's my great pleasure to be back now.
如今再次回到这里，我感到非常荣幸。

893
01:19:32,360 --> 01:19:40,020
A way of looking at things is there's no one way to fit all applications, and we really try to meet users where they are.
一种看待问题的方式是，没有一种通用方案适用于所有应用，我们真正努力的是在用户所在的位置满足他们的需求。

894
01:19:40,020 --> 01:19:43,200
So for that reason, we've developed multiple solutions.
因此，我们开发了多种解决方案。

895
01:19:43,920 --> 01:19:50,000
So for workflows where speed of iterations is more important, we've developed Triton, as you mentioned.
对于迭代速度更为重要的工作流，我们开发了 Triton，正如你提到的那样。

896
01:19:50,240 --> 01:19:52,680
So this is typically what researchers will use.
这通常是研究人员会使用的方式。

897
01:19:53,340 --> 01:20:00,520
But more and more, we've been in a case where we've had to hyper-optimize performance, and Triton didn't give us the level of control that we wanted.
但越来越多的情况下，我们不得不对性能进行超优化，而 Triton 并未提供我们所期望的控制程度。

898
01:20:00,980 --> 01:20:04,380
So we've developed Glion for that, which is a lower-level language.
因此我们开发了 Glion，这是一种更低层级的语言。

899
01:20:05,560 --> 01:20:10,780
And this way, we've been really able to optimize our kernels for AMD, among other things.
通过这种方式，我们真正实现了对 AMD 等平台的内核优化。

900
01:20:13,500 --> 01:20:19,440
Our agents have become extremely good at both of them, and we've worked with AMD on both of them as well.
我们的代理在两者上都变得极为出色，我们也与 AMD 在这两者上都有合作。

901
01:20:21,800 --> 01:20:26,060
More and more, what we're seeing is agents slowly taking over.
越来越多的情况下，我们看到的是代理程序正在逐步接管。

902
01:20:27,880 --> 01:20:31,280
They're getting just very good, as you just mentioned, at writing this kind of code.
正如你刚才提到的，它们在编写这类代码方面变得非常出色。

903
01:20:31,280 --> 01:20:32,100
Amazing.
惊人。

904
01:20:32,740 --> 01:20:39,460
So look, I think the work you have done with Triton and now Glion, it's been really, really moving the ball forward for the entire industry.
所以，我认为你之前在 Triton 上的工作，以及现在在 Glion 上的工作，真的极大地推动了整个行业的发展。

905
01:20:40,020 --> 01:20:47,780
Now, we began our work together with 300 and extended at 350, but now we're collaborating at a different scale with 450 and Helios.
我们最初是与 300 合作，后来扩展到 350，但现在我们正以全新的规模与 450 和 Helios 合作。

906
01:20:48,240 --> 01:20:53,480
