所以我很想听听你对这次合作进展的看法，以及你的体验如何？

907
01:20:53,980 --> 01:20:54,660
Yeah, super well.
非常顺利。

908
01:20:54,940 --> 01:20:56,520
It feels like ages.
感觉已经过了很久。

909
01:20:56,800 --> 01:21:00,360
I think we started years ago on hardware co-design.
我认为我们多年前就开始了硬件协同设计。

910
01:21:00,360 --> 01:21:10,740
You know, when MI450 was in the very early prototyping stages, I think we were able to work really well together, and it's so nice to see the outcome of that and the
当 MI450 还处于非常早期的原型阶段时，我们就已经能够很好地协作，现在看到成果，真是太棒了。

911
01:21:10,740 --> 01:21:21,460
chip. And more recently, we've been working very, very deeply on software enablement for MI450, both for our models, but also for the broader ecosystem.
最近，我们还在 MI450 的软件赋能方面进行了非常深入的合作，不仅针对我们的模型，也面向更广泛的生态系统。

912
01:21:21,740 --> 01:21:24,100
So a lot of this development has been done open source.
因此，大量开发工作都是以开源形式完成的。

913
01:21:25,420 --> 01:21:38,260
And yeah, we're collaborating on the full stack now, down to the very low-level LLVM code generation, so that all the nice hardware advances that came with MI450 can
是的，我们现在正在全栈合作，深入到最底层的LLVM代码生成层面，以便充分利用MI450带来的所有硬件优势，

914
01:21:38,260 --> 01:21:40,880
be properly leveraged in end-to-end applications.
在端到端的应用中得到充分应用。

915
01:21:42,020 --> 01:21:46,540
Yeah, and you got your Helios racks, so tell us a little bit about that.
是的，你们有Helios机架，跟我们说说那方面的情况吧。

916
01:21:46,720 --> 01:21:47,660
Yeah, it worked.
是的，它运行成功了。

917
01:21:48,480 --> 01:21:49,980
We got the chip,
我们拿到了芯片，

918
01:21:56,650 --> 01:22:03,050
and very quickly, a single engineer in a few days was able to confirm that everything worked.
很快，一名工程师在几天内就确认了所有功能都正常。

919
01:22:03,250 --> 01:22:05,350
Obviously, we have to optimize performance more.
当然，我们还需要进一步优化性能。

920
01:22:06,290 --> 01:22:09,370
But we're very confident we can get in a very, very good place.
但我们非常有信心能取得非常出色的结果。

921
01:22:09,930 --> 01:22:10,370
Awesome.
太棒了。

922
01:22:10,370 --> 01:22:11,250
That's awesome to hear.
听到这个消息真是太棒了。

923
01:22:11,790 --> 01:22:21,910
So look, one of the more amazing things that we've done recently is our teams have collaborated even more closely in terms of using AI to program AMD GPUs.
说起来，我们最近做得最令人惊叹的一件事是，我们的团队在使用AI编程AMD显卡方面，合作得更加紧密了。

924
01:22:22,570 --> 01:22:25,850
So we'd love to hear your thoughts and anything you can share with the audience.
所以我们很乐意听听您的看法，以及您能与观众分享的任何内容。

925
01:22:25,850 --> 01:22:35,890
Yeah, no, I mean, everyone in this room knows how much agents are taking over our jobs, in a sense, as kernel engineers.
是的，我的意思是，在座的每个人都知道，智能体正在以某种方式逐渐取代我们这些内核工程师的工作。

926
01:22:38,570 --> 01:22:45,210
And it's been amazing just to see how much better they've got over just the past six months.
仅仅过去六个月，它们的进步就令人惊叹。

927
01:22:45,450 --> 01:22:50,930
And just now, they're extremely good at generating high-quality GPU kernels in a way that were not before.
而现在，它们在生成高质量GPU内核方面表现得极为出色，这是以前做不到的。

928
01:22:51,630 --> 01:23:04,530
And it's been very great collaborating with AMD on just making sure that agents not only are capable enough, but also have all the right context they need to be able
与AMD合作，确保智能体不仅能力足够，还能获得所有必要的上下文信息，从而做出良好决策和优化，这感觉非常棒。

929
01:23:04,530 --> 01:23:06,750
to make good decisions and good optimizations.
这感觉非常棒。

930
01:23:07,410 --> 01:23:08,010
It's great to hear.
听起来太棒了。

931
01:23:08,330 --> 01:23:17,030
I think the quality of code that's getting produced by AI-assisted kernel generation has been truly remarkable through our collaboration.
我认为，通过我们的合作，AI辅助的内核生成所产出的代码质量确实令人瞩目。

932
01:23:17,470 --> 01:23:18,010
Very excited.
非常令人兴奋。

933
01:23:18,010 --> 01:23:27,450
Now, as you look ahead, what crystal ball do you have for us for the future of AI software ecosystem and collaborations like ours?
现在，展望未来，您对AI软件生态系统的未来以及像我们这样的合作有什么预测吗？

934
01:23:28,170 --> 01:23:31,050
Yeah, so there's two things that really come to mind.
是的，有两件事让我印象特别深刻。

935
01:23:31,370 --> 01:23:36,250
One, as we keep talking, is just how good agents are getting.
一个是，随着我们持续交流，智能体的能力正在变得越来越强。

936
01:23:36,830 --> 01:23:46,250
And the other one is, I think, how much the open approach to software of AMD is enabling, not only for OpenAI, but I think for the industry as a whole.
另一个则是，我认为AMD在软件上采取的开放策略，不仅为OpenAI，也为我们整个行业带来了巨大推动。

937
01:23:46,250 --> 01:23:50,750
I talked a little bit earlier how we've been collaborating on LLVM co-generation.
我刚才简单提到了我们如何在LLVM共同生成方面展开合作。

938
01:23:51,230 --> 01:23:53,070
LLVM is an open source project.
LLVM是一个开源项目。

939
01:23:53,510 --> 01:23:56,470
The entire compiler stack from AMD is open source.
AMD整个编译器栈都是开源的。

940
01:23:56,970 --> 01:24:05,290
And that has allowed us to make our agents really good at very, very low-level co-generation, down to scheduling instructions in assembly.
这使我们能够将代理在非常非常底层的共同生成方面做到极致，甚至精确到汇编指令的调度。

941
01:24:05,550 --> 01:24:15,150
And this has led to very, very significant performance gain that I don't think we'd have been able to achieve in a fully closed source stack.
这带来了极为显著的性能提升，我认为在完全闭源的架构下我们无法实现这一点。

942
01:24:15,150 --> 01:24:20,870
Yeah, that's one of the real sort of big value propositions that we have to offer,
是的，这正是我们能提供的一大核心价值主张。

943
01:24:21,090 --> 01:24:27,030
Because everything that we do is in the open, and the fact that AI can actually right? pick that up is a big one.
因为我们所做的每一件事都是公开的，而AI实际上能够利用这一点，这非常重要。

