949
01:24:42,390 --> 01:24:51,390
When we combine better abstractions with AI-assisted development and closed hardware software co-design, we can create some incredibly powerful capabilities,
当我们把更优的抽象技术与AI辅助开发及软硬件一体化设计相结合时，就能创造出一些极其强大的能力。

