The MI430X is built by leveraging our modular chiplet architecture to deliver a purpose-built variant with native FP64 hardware, giving customers leadership
MI430X 基于我们的模块化小芯片架构打造，提供具备原生 FP64 硬件的专用版本，为客户带来领先地位

