to deliver the right compute engine to the right workload, and then continuously drive optimization points across our entire portfolio, from CPUs, GPUs, networking, and FPGAs.
为合适的任务匹配合适的计算引擎，并持续优化我们整个产品组合，涵盖 CPU、GPU、网络和 FPGA。

