01:31:33,990 --> 01:31:43,450
capabilities, giving customers the flexibility to choose the right solution for their workload, and most importantly, at the most optimized cost.
这些能力让客户能够灵活选择最适合其工作负载的解决方案，最重要的是，实现成本最优。

