一块 MI350P 可支持高达 2600 亿个参数，使客户能够在单个 GPU 上运行大部分企业 AI 工作负载。

1036
01:35:20,290 --> 01:35:24,370
And the economics are actually even better and more compelling.
经济性实际上更加优越且更具吸引力。

1037
01:35:25,010 --> 01:35:30,830
The 350P delivers more than four times the tokens per second per dollar than the competition.
MI350P 每美元每秒处理的词元数量是竞争对手的四倍以上。

1038
01:35:32,130 --> 01:35:33,310
It's pretty cool.
这真的很棒。

1039
01:35:36,100 --> 01:35:43,220
And it actually turns the customer's existing data center into an AI data center.
它实际上将客户现有的数据中心转变为 AI 数据中心。

1040
01:35:43,980 --> 01:35:49,260
Now, we all know that benchmarks are one part of the equation, right?
现在，我们都知道基准测试只是方程的一部分，对吧？

1041
01:35:49,360 --> 01:35:56,380
The other part is really evaluating, does the advantage hold up across the actual workload you run and how your business runs?
另一部分是真正评估，这种优势是否在您实际运行的工作负载以及业务运作中依然成立？

1042
01:35:56,820 --> 01:36:02,180
So we tested a set of workloads, enterprise use cases, using production models.
因此我们使用生产模型测试了一组工作负载和企业应用场景。

1043
01:36:02,880 --> 01:36:12,980
And the 350P delivers much higher productivity than the competition, delivering up to two to five times faster tokens per second than the competition.
MI350P 的生产力远超竞争对手，每秒词元处理速度最高比竞争对手快两到五倍。

