A personal agent can double what one person can do.
一个个人代理可以将一个人的效率翻倍。

1149
01:46:34,320 --> 01:46:36,360
A team of agents can multiply that by 10.
一组代理可以将这一效率提升十倍。

1150
01:46:37,040 --> 01:46:41,420
And as agents gain more capabilities, the opportunity can grow exponentially.
随着代理能力的增强，机遇将呈指数级增长。

1151
01:46:41,420 --> 01:46:44,080
But that promise has a compute consequence.
但这一承诺也带来了计算上的后果。

1152
01:46:44,800 --> 01:46:57,340
Unlike a single AI query, as agent reasons, calls tools, and coordinates to other agents, and run nonstop, agents become more capable and pervasive.
与单次AI查询不同，当代理在推理、调用工具、与其他代理协调并持续运行时，它们会变得越来越强大且无处不在。

1153
01:46:57,880 --> 01:47:05,080
So will token consumption, meaning that demand will require every layer of the computing ecosystem to scale together.
词元消耗也将随之增加，这意味着需求将要求计算生态系统的每一层协同扩展。

1154
01:47:05,920 --> 01:47:10,700
Data centers remain the foundation for frontier AI in the most demanding workloads.
数据中心仍然是应对最严苛工作负载的前沿人工智能的基础。

1155
01:47:10,700 --> 01:47:20,400
But edge-inclined systems can extend that capacity, putting more intelligence closer to where data is created and where the work gets done.
但偏向边缘的系统可以扩展这种能力，将更多智能置于数据生成和工作执行的附近。

1156
01:47:21,200 --> 01:47:27,140
The PC is already one of the most powerful compute engines ever placed in the hands of an individual.
个人电脑已经是个人手中最强大的计算引擎之一。

1157
01:47:27,600 --> 01:47:36,640
Across billions of devices, enormous computing capability is already deployed every single day, yet its potential remains largely untapped.
在数十亿设备上，巨大的计算能力每天都在被部署，但其潜力仍大多未被开发。

1158
01:47:37,320 --> 01:47:40,540
Putting that capacity to work changed the economics of computing.
将这种能力投入使用，改变了计算的经济性。

1159
01:47:41,340 --> 01:47:51,280
More workloads can run on systems that are already in place, reducing overall infrastructure costs and allowing data centers to focus on the largest, most demanding task.
更多工作负载可以在现有系统上运行，从而降低整体基础设施成本，并让数据中心能够专注于最大、最严苛的任务。

1160
01:47:52,020 --> 01:47:54,540
And local computing brings inherent advantages.
本地计算带来了固有的优势。

1161
01:47:55,180 --> 01:48:04,020
Your data stays with you, your applications remain responsive, and your system keeps working, even when your network does not.
你的数据始终在你身边，你的应用程序保持响应，即使网络中断，你的系统仍能正常运行。

1162
01:48:04,460 --> 01:48:11,760
And thanks to a new generation of smaller, more capable AI models, we're beginning to unlock that potential.
由于新一代更小、更强大的AI模型，我们正开始释放这种潜力。

1163
01:48:12,840 --> 01:48:16,600
And the unlock is happening faster than anyone expected.
这种潜力的释放速度比任何人预期的都要快。

1164
01:48:17,280 --> 01:48:25,320
Last August, GPT OSS needed 120 billion parameters to score 80 on GPQA.
去年八月，GPT OSS 需要1200亿参数才能在GPQA上获得80分。

1165
01:48:25,900 --> 01:48:32,060
Just seven months later, Qwen 3.5 scored even higher, with only 9 billion.
仅七个月后，Qwen 3.5 的得分更高，参数量仅为 90 亿。

1166
01:48:32,860 --> 01:48:36,380
Better performance, with 13 times fewer parameters.
性能更优，参数量仅为之前的十三分之一。

1167
01:48:36,380 --> 01:48:39,340
This is not an incremental improvement.
这并非渐进式改进。

1168
01:48:39,940 --> 01:48:44,900
It's a dramatic shift in the compute required to deliver advanced intelligence.
它标志着实现先进智能所需计算能力的显著转变。

1169
01:48:45,500 --> 01:48:48,080
And this is a trend, not an outlier.
这是一种趋势，而非偶然现象。

1170
01:48:49,060 --> 01:48:54,060
Smaller, open models are closing the frontier gap at extraordinary speed.
更小、开源的模型正以惊人的速度缩小与前沿模型之间的差距。

1171
01:48:54,820 --> 01:49:10,460
Qwen 3.6, 27 billion parameters now outperforms leading frontier models from the previous generation on graduate-level reasoning, at a fraction of the size and cost. That changes what is possible.
Qwen 3.6 目前拥有 270 亿参数，在研究生级推理任务上已超越上一代领先前沿模型，体积和成本仅为它们的几分之一。这改变了可能的边界。

1172
01:49:11,720 --> 01:49:19,560
Workloads once reserved for the cloud can now run on powerful compute engines designed for personal AI compute.
过去仅限于云端的负载，如今可在专为个人 AI 计算设计的强大计算引擎上运行。

1173
01:49:20,640 --> 01:49:25,220
Let's map these model performance breakthroughs to any platforms.
让我们把这些模型性能突破映射到各类平台。

1174
01:49:26,120 --> 01:49:38,100
Ryzen AI 400 supports models up to 24 billion parameters, more than enough for Qwen 3.5, 9 billion, with substantial headroom.
Ryzen AI 400 支持高达 240 亿参数的模型，远超 Qwen 3.5 的 90 亿参数，且留有充足余量。

1175
01:49:38,920 --> 01:49:47,780
Ryzen AI Max extends that capacity to models as large as 200 billion parameters, running natively on a personal system.
Ryzen AI Max 将这一能力扩展至高达 2000 亿参数的模型，可在个人系统上原生运行。

1176
01:49:48,560 --> 01:49:52,000
This has not reduced AI, compressed to fit on a PC.
这并未将 AI 压缩到仅适合 PC 的程度。

1177
01:49:52,600 --> 01:49:59,160
It is a new class of personal computing built to run powerful models where the work actually happens.
这是一种全新的个人计算平台，专为在实际工作地点运行强大模型而设计。

1178
01:49:59,940 --> 01:50:04,580
And this is exactly what led us to build Ryzen AI Halo.
这正是我们决定打造锐龙AI光环的原因。

1179
01:50:05,200 --> 01:50:12,960
We wanted to give developers a platform powerful enough to run these models locally, yet simple enough to use every day.
我们希望为开发者提供一个足够强大以在本地运行这些模型，同时又足够简单以便日常使用的平台。

1180
01:50:13,400 --> 01:50:27,320
With 120 gigabytes of unified memory and support for models up to 200 billion parameters, developers can build, test, and iterate locally directly on their desk.
拥有120GB统一内存并支持高达2000亿参数的模型，开发者可以直接在桌面上本地构建、测试和迭代。

1181
01:50:28,180 --> 01:50:37,740
Ryzen AI Halo embodies the future of personal AI for everyone, a future that shortens the distance between an idea and a working model.
锐龙AI光环体现了每个人都能享有的个人AI未来，一个缩短了从想法到可用模型之间距离的未来。

1182
01:50:38,220 --> 01:50:45,660
For developers, that means a dramatically more efficient and optimized path from experimentation to deployment.
对开发者而言，这意味着从实验到部署的路径实现了显著更高的效率和优化。

1183
01:50:46,460 --> 01:50:53,000
And as Vamsi showed earlier, rocm.ai is making hardware programming radically more accessible.
正如瓦姆西此前展示的那样，rocm.ai 正使硬件编程变得前所未有的易用。

1184
01:50:54,220 --> 01:51:02,640
Developers can understand, modify, and optimize code for ROCm, even without deep ROCm expertise.
开发者无需深入掌握ROCm知识，也能理解、修改和优化ROCm代码。

1185
01:51:03,360 --> 01:51:09,600
And better yet, the same open software foundation extends across all of AMD's hardware.
更棒的是，这一开放软件基础覆盖了AMD全部硬件。

1186
01:51:10,200 --> 01:51:21,020
Developers can use the frameworks and tools they already know, start locally on Ryzen AI Halo, and scale across the full AMD compute platform without rebuilding their work.
开发者可以使用他们已熟悉的框架和工具，在锐龙AI光环上本地启动，然后无缝扩展到整个AMD计算平台，无需重新构建工作。

1187
01:51:22,060 --> 01:51:23,280
And we're not stopping there.
我们不会止步于此。

1188
01:51:23,740 --> 01:51:32,380
Today, we're expanding our partnership with Hugging Face to bring the open AI ecosystem directly on Ryzen AI Halo.
今天，我们正扩大与Hugging Face的合作，将开放AI生态直接带入锐龙AI光环。

1189
01:51:33,320 --> 01:51:44,260
Powerful compute only creates value when developers can quickly access the right models, optimize them for the platform, and turn them into real applications.
只有当开发者能够快速获取合适的模型、针对平台进行优化并将其转化为实际应用时，强大的算力才能创造价值。

1190
01:51:45,000 --> 01:51:53,100
Together, AMD and Hugging Face will deliver Halo optimized performance for open models and agentic workflows.
AMD 和 Hugging Face 将共同提供针对开源模型和代理工作流优化的 Halo 性能。

1191
01:51:56,180 --> 01:51:58,060
How cool is that?
这太酷了。

1192
01:51:59,400 --> 01:52:08,000
And along with co-engineered libraries and toolkits designed to help developers spend less time configuring infrastructure and more time building.
同时，还有共同设计的库和工具包，帮助开发者减少配置基础设施的时间，更多地专注于开发。

1193
01:52:08,860 --> 01:52:20,740
And later this year, every Ryzen AI Halo box will include a full year of Hugging Face Pro, putting the power of partnership in developers' hands from day one.
今年晚些时候，每一台 Ryzen AI Halo 电脑都将包含一整年的 Hugging Face Pro，从第一天起就将合作的力量交到开发者手中。

1194
01:52:21,520 --> 01:52:24,000
Freedom and more power to the user.
给用户更多自由和更强的能力。

1195
01:52:25,140 --> 01:52:29,780
This is how we accelerate innovation in the AI era.
这就是我们在 AI 时代加速创新的方式。

1196
01:52:30,300 --> 01:52:34,280
And we're already pushing that vision further with Gorgon Halo.
我们已经通过 Gorgon Halo 进一步推进了这一愿景。

1197
01:52:35,760 --> 01:52:41,220
And seeing is believing, look at how small and beautiful this box is.
眼见为实，看看这个盒子是多么小巧精致。

1198
01:52:46,080 --> 01:52:53,020
We've increased unified memory from 128 to 192 gigabytes.
统一内存已从 128GB 提升至 192GB。

1199
01:52:53,540 --> 01:52:56,440
The largest unified memory pool in this class.
这个级别中最大的统一内存池。

1200
01:52:56,920 --> 01:53:01,500
And increased model support from 200 billion to 300 billion parameters.
模型支持参数量从 2000 亿提升至 3000 亿。

1201
01:53:03,200 --> 01:53:03,920
Thank you, Laura.
谢谢你，劳拉。

1202
01:53:06,870 --> 01:53:10,650
And this is no longer limited to a single platform form factor.
这已不再局限于单一平台形态。

1203
01:53:11,050 --> 01:53:17,770
Together, with the world's leading OEMs, AMD now powers the broadest portfolio of personal AI systems.
与全球领先的OEM厂商合作，AMD如今为最广泛的个人AI系统提供了动力。

1204
01:53:18,270 --> 01:53:22,710
From laptops and workstations to mini PCs and developer platforms.
从笔记本电脑和工作站，到迷你电脑和开发者平台。

1205
01:53:23,170 --> 01:53:30,790
That means developers, enterprises, and creators can choose the right system for the way they want to build and work.
这意味着开发者、企业及创作者可以根据自己的构建和工作方式选择合适的系统。

1206
01:53:31,610 --> 01:53:33,310
Personal AI is not a concept.
个人AI不是一个概念。

1207
01:53:33,690 --> 01:53:37,050
It is a category and is available right now on AMD.
它是一个类别，现在已在AMD上可用。

1208
01:53:38,830 --> 01:53:40,650
We now have all the pieces.
我们现在已具备所有要素。

1209
01:53:41,650 --> 01:53:43,010
Models are efficient enough.
模型已足够高效。

1210
01:53:43,770 --> 01:53:45,250
Hardware is powerful enough.
硬件已足够强大。

1211
01:53:45,970 --> 01:53:47,750
Software stack is open and ready.
软件栈开放且已准备就绪。

1212
01:53:48,310 --> 01:53:53,310
And open harnesses like Lemonade Server can route workloads to the right model and right compute.
开放式框架如Lemonade Server可将工作负载导向正确的模型和正确的计算资源。

1213
01:53:54,050 --> 01:53:55,370
The technology is here.
这项技术已经到来。

1214
01:53:55,930 --> 01:54:01,330
The next challenge is taking it from one developer's desk to thousands of users across an enterprise.
下一个挑战是将它从一名开发者的桌面推广到企业中的数千名用户。

1215
01:54:02,110 --> 01:54:05,090
Cisco sees and believes in that future the same way we do.
思科和我们一样，看到了那个未来，并且相信它。

1216
01:54:05,630 --> 01:54:09,630
To take us deeper into how we turn that vision into enterprise scale reality,
为了更深入地了解我们如何将这一愿景变为企业规模的现实，

1217
01:54:10,330 --> 01:54:15,850
please join me in welcoming to the stage Jeetu Patel, President and Chief Product Officer at Cisco.
请和我一起欢迎思科公司总裁兼首席产品官杰图·帕特尔登台。

1218
01:54:19,450 --> 01:54:20,570
Jeetu, how are you doing?
杰图，你好吗？

1219
01:54:20,870 --> 01:54:21,350
How are you?
你好。

1220
01:54:21,350 --> 01:54:21,930
You look great.
你看起来状态很好。

1221
01:54:21,930 --> 01:54:23,890
Thank you for joining me here today.
感谢你今天来到这里。

1222
01:54:24,270 --> 01:54:24,770
Congratulations.
恭喜你。

1223
01:54:25,230 --> 01:54:26,150
Thank you, thank you.
谢谢，谢谢。

1224
01:54:26,470 --> 01:54:28,770
Now Jeetu, you and I talk how we're at an inflection point.
现在杰图，你我都知道我们正处在一个转折点。

1225
01:54:29,350 --> 01:54:34,130
And for the past few years, industry has spent time just building intelligence.
过去几年里，产业界一直在专注于构建智能。

1226
01:54:34,790 --> 01:54:38,230
The next phase is how we deploy this technology at scale enterprises.
下一阶段是如何将这项技术大规模部署到企业中。

1227
01:54:38,750 --> 01:54:42,430
You spent so much of your time talking to CIOs, technology leaders.
你花了大量时间与首席信息官和技术领导者交谈。

1228
01:54:42,850 --> 01:54:43,550
What are they telling you?
他们告诉了你什么？

1229
01:54:43,610 --> 01:54:44,150
What's changing?
有哪些变化？

1230
01:54:44,770 --> 01:54:47,290
Well, firstly, it's a really exciting time to be alive in tech.
