1232
01:54:55,150 --> 01:55:01,470
So if you think about the patterns of inferencing that existed during the chatbot era that was human-led, it was very, very spiky.
想想聊天机器人时代的人类主导推理模式，那时的模式非常不规则且波动剧烈。

1233
01:55:01,610 --> 01:55:03,130
You ask a question, you get an answer.
你提出一个问题，就会得到一个回答。

1234
01:55:03,290 --> 01:55:06,150
What you're starting to see with agents is they're working 7x24.
你开始看到代理正在全天候、每周七天不间断地工作。

1235
01:55:07,890 --> 01:55:10,730
They're very consumptive on bandwidth and on infrastructure.
它们对带宽和基础设施的消耗非常大。

1236
01:55:10,730 --> 01:55:15,750
So you're starting to see a much more persistent pattern of kind of demand signal for infrastructure.
因此，你开始看到基础设施需求信号呈现出一种更加持续的模式。

1237
01:55:16,210 --> 01:55:20,870
You know, we usually joke around internally, humans click, but agents swarm.
你知道，我们内部通常开玩笑说，人类点击，而智能体则成群涌动。

1238
01:55:22,190 --> 01:55:31,670
And so as you start to see this, what you're going to have is a tremendous amount of and there's two big concerns that are also there, which is one is every
所以当你开始看到这一点时，你会意识到这将带来巨大的变化，同时也有两个主要担忧，一个是每个

1239
01:55:31,670 --> 01:55:36,450
customer is concerned about security and every customer is concerned about cost.
客户都关心安全，每个客户都关心成本。

1240
01:55:36,990 --> 01:55:42,950
So what you're starting to see happen is inferencing is not just going to be limited to the data center.
所以你开始看到的是，推理计算将不再局限于数据中心。

1241
01:55:43,130 --> 01:55:50,610
Inferencing is going to be distributed everywhere and there's a whole new class of computing that's emerging with this desk-side computing that you just
推理计算将分布到各个地方，由此出现了一种全新的计算形态，就像你刚刚宣布的桌面计算那样，将

1242
01:55:50,610 --> 01:55:58,550
announced where there's going to be inferencing that you're going to have a laptop or a desktop where humans work, and they might have a desk-side computer
出现推理能力，你可能会有一台笔记本电脑或台式机，供人类工作使用，同时可能还有一台桌面级计算机

1243
01:55:58,550 --> 01:56:02,850
where agents are kind of going out and running their jobs on behalf of humans.
用于智能体代为运行任务。

1244
01:56:02,950 --> 01:56:05,150
So that's what we're seeing, essentially.
这就是我们正在看到的实质。

1245
01:56:05,290 --> 01:56:08,590
We're fully aligned Jeetu and that's exactly the shift we're seeing.
我们完全认同杰图的观点，这正是我们所看到的转变。

1246
01:56:09,010 --> 01:56:12,870
If AI is moving closer to employees, compute has to move closer as well.
如果AI正向员工靠近，计算能力也必须随之靠近。

1247
01:56:12,870 --> 01:56:24,110
The PC's knowledge as a productivity device becomes an intelligence node in the enterprise but deploying intelligence everywhere creates a new trend for CIOs that you and I talk about so much.
个人电脑作为生产力设备的知识，将转变为企业的智能节点，但将智能部署到各个地方，也带来了CIO们长期讨论的新趋势。

1248
01:56:24,890 --> 01:56:31,150
How do you operate thousands of these systems with the security, governance and control enterprises require?
如何在确保安全、治理和企业所需控制的前提下，管理成千上万的这类系统？

1249
01:56:31,770 --> 01:56:36,510
Jeetu, how is AMD and Cisco solving this and what are we building together?
杰图，AMD 和思科是如何解决这个问题的？我们又在共同打造什么？

1250
01:56:36,830 --> 01:56:43,130
Yeah, so this is an exciting time because what you're starting to see is there's a few things that need to really be done.
是的，现在正是令人兴奋的时刻，因为你们开始看到，有几件事真的需要完成。

1251
