Florence 将搭载下一代 Zen 7 核心。

1375
02:08:04,000 --> 02:08:05,720
It's leading-edge process technology.
它采用前沿的制程技术。

1376
02:08:05,860 --> 02:08:11,960
It's a new set of AI compute extensions to really ensure that we have all of the AI capability.
它配备了一套全新的 AI 计算扩展，以确保我们具备全部的 AI 能力。

1377
02:08:12,180 --> 02:08:14,440
And it supports the latest memory technologies.
并支持最新的内存技术。

1378
02:08:14,860 --> 02:08:16,060
And we're not stopping there.
但我们不会止步于此。

1379
02:08:16,300 --> 02:08:22,180
We're already deep in development of Ravenna, our eighth-generation EPYC family built on Zen 8.
我们已经深入开发 Ravenna，这是基于 Zen 8 的第八代 EPYC 系列。

1380
02:08:22,620 --> 02:08:26,040
And that family is already well under development for 2030.
而这一系列已经提前进入 2030 年的开发阶段。

1381
02:08:27,400 --> 02:08:33,520
Now, to give you a little bit of a flavor, Florence is again going to extend our biggest advantage with EPYC.
现在，先给大家一点感觉，弗洛伦萨将继续拓展我们EPYC最大的优势。

1382
02:08:33,760 --> 02:08:41,300
It's all about product breath and having the right foundation and also the right family for each workload.
这关乎产品广度，以及为每种工作负载提供正确的基础和合适的系列。

1383
02:08:41,520 --> 02:08:44,820
So you have Florence, you have Ferrara, you have Fidenza.
所以你有弗洛伦萨，有费拉拉，有菲登扎。

1384
02:08:45,220 --> 02:08:51,220
And it's really built on a full family of CPUs that is optimized for these different workloads.
它建立在一套完整的、针对不同工作负载优化的CPU家族之上。

1385
02:08:51,220 --> 02:08:55,160
That's giving the customers the right CPU for every workload.
这为客户提供每个工作负载所需的正确CPU。

1386
02:08:55,560 --> 02:08:57,400
And that is our commitment with EPYC.
这就是我们对EPYC的承诺。

1387
02:08:58,540 --> 02:08:59,880
Now, moving to Instinct.
现在转向Instinct。

1388
02:09:00,500 --> 02:09:06,060
We are continuing our cadence of delivering a new generation every single year.
我们将继续保持每年发布新一代产品的节奏。

1389
02:09:06,800 --> 02:09:09,540
MI500 brings next-generation HBM.
MI500带来了下一代HBM。

1390
02:09:10,020 --> 02:09:14,080
It brings a larger scale-up domain because scaling is everything.
它带来了更大的扩展域，因为扩展至关重要。

1391
02:09:14,520 --> 02:09:18,280
And it introduces new copper and optical interconnects.
并引入了新的铜质和光互连技术。

1392
02:09:18,560 --> 02:09:25,280
And with MI600, it's powered by our CDNA Next architecture, and it's already deep in development for 2028.
而MI600则基于我们的CDNA Next架构，目前已深入开发，目标为2028年推出。

1393
02:09:26,300 --> 02:09:35,880
Now, to give you an idea of what we see from a performance standpoint, every generation of Instinct has delivered a major big step up in performance.
从性能角度来看，每一代Instinct都实现了性能的显著提升。

1394
02:09:36,560 --> 02:09:43,660
And with MI455, we've talked a lot about it, delivering 35 times more inference throughput compared to MI355.
而MI455，我们已经讨论过很多，其推理吞吐量相比MI355提升了35倍。

1395
02:09:44,540 --> 02:09:47,280
But we're really, really excited about MI500.
但我们现在真正兴奋的是MI500。

1396
02:09:47,720 --> 02:09:53,980
What we see is another opportunity to take a major step up and actually bend the curve again.
我们看到的是一次再次实现重大飞跃的机遇，甚至能再次扭转曲线。

1397
02:09:54,580 --> 02:10:05,600
So MI500 will deliver the largest generational leap in the industry of Instinct, putting us on track to deliver more than 2,000 times higher inference throughput in just four years.
因此，MI500将成为Instinct系列中代际提升最大的产品，让我们有望在短短四年内实现推理吞吐量超过2000倍的提升。

1398
02:10:12,900 --> 02:10:17,820
Now, what I can tell you is we are working with a number of our customers already on this design point.
目前我可以告诉你们的是，我们已经与多家客户开始合作推进这一设计。

1399
02:10:18,140 --> 02:10:24,240
MI500 is super exciting, and the feedback we're getting from customers is just fantastic.
MI500令人非常兴奋，客户反馈也极为出色。

1400
02:10:24,760 --> 02:10:32,960
Now, put the CPU, GPU, and the networking roadmaps together, and you can now see a complete cadence of our rack scale systems.
现在将CPU、GPU和网络技术路线图整合起来，你就能看到我们机架级系统完整的演进节奏。

1401
02:10:33,300 --> 02:10:45,980
So you should expect from AMD a new Helios system every year delivering more performance, more capacity so that we can run larger models, more agents at better total cost of ownership.
因此，AMD每年都会推出新一代Helios系统，带来更高的性能和更大的容量，让我们能够运行更大规模的模型，支持更多智能体，同时降低总体拥有成本。

1402
02:10:46,440 --> 02:10:54,140
And that gives our customers the complete, predictable roadmap to plan and scale their infrastructure for years to come.
这为我们的客户提供了完整且可预测的技术路线图，便于他们规划和扩展未来数年的基础设施。

1403
02:10:54,400 --> 02:10:57,980
So lots of exciting things in store over the next few years.
未来几年将有大量令人兴奋的进展。

1404
02:10:58,600 --> 02:11:01,380
So with that, let me wrap this up for this morning.
好了，那么今天上午就讲到这里，我来做个总结。

1405
02:11:02,060 --> 02:11:08,820
Today, I hope you saw a little bit about how we're really looking at that compute from every angle.
今天，我希望你们看到了我们如何从各个角度来审视计算。

1406
02:11:09,140 --> 02:11:22,700
So every aspect of AI compute, whether you're talking about Helios or MI455 or Venice for the world's largest AI systems, or you're talking about MI430 and MI350 for Sovereign and Enterprise AI.
因此，无论是讨论用于全球最大AI系统的Helios或MI455或Venice，还是讨论用于主权和企业AI的MI430和MI350，我们都在关注AI计算的各个方面。

1407
02:11:23,300 --> 02:11:25,700
You saw the passion in Vamsi with ROCm AI.
你们看到了瓦姆西在ROCm AI方面的热情。

1408
02:11:26,300 --> 02:11:35,960
It's so good to see how much has come through that platform in terms of making developers make it much, much easier for developers to access the AMD platform.
看到这个平台在帮助开发者更轻松地接入AMD平台方面取得了如此多的进展，真是太好了。

1409
02:11:36,700 --> 02:11:46,940
And then Jack talked about Gorgon Halo and our new Kria AI platforms really bringing together the leadership of the end-to-end AI story, including PCs and physical AI.
然后杰克谈到了Gorgon Halo以及我们的全新Kria AI平台，真正整合了端到端AI故事的领导力，包括个人电脑和物理AI。

1410
02:11:47,360 --> 02:11:56,200
So lots of new information, but I want to say a very, very special thank you to all of our partners who joined us today because it is really through those
今天有很多新信息，但我想特别感谢所有今天加入我们的合作伙伴，因为正是通过这些合作，

1411
02:11:56,200 --> 02:12:00,380
partnerships that we're able to do the most amazing things together.
我们才能共同完成最了不起的事情。

1412
02:12:01,400 --> 02:12:12,780
So if I just leave you with a final thought, when I think about where AI is today, the biggest change that we see is we're no longer talking about what might be possible.
如果让我留下一个最后的想法，当我思考AI今天所处的位置时，最大的变化是，我们不再只是讨论可能实现什么。

1413
02:12:13,140 --> 02:12:22,560
We're actually seeing how AI can have real and significant impact across every industry and every part of our lives, our personal lives.
我们实际上正在看到AI如何在每个行业以及我们生活的方方面面，包括个人生活，产生真实而重大的影响。

1414
02:12:22,560 --> 02:12:32,000
And I have to say that I've spent my entire career in tech believing that high-performance computing can make the world an incredibly better place.
我必须说，我整个职业生涯都在科技领域，一直相信高性能计算能让世界变得无比美好。

1415
02:12:32,400 --> 02:12:35,380
And I have never, ever believed that more than I do today.
但我从未像今天这样，如此坚定地相信这一点。

1416
02:12:36,400 --> 02:12:48,080
At AMD, what we're focused on is building the technology, the roadmaps, and the partnerships, and there's never been a more exciting moment than today for our 30,000 plus engineers.
在AMD，我们专注于构建技术、路线图和合作伙伴关系，而对我们三万多名工程师来说，今天是前所未有的激动时刻。

1417
02:12:48,760 --> 02:12:51,240
This is really the next phase of AI.
这确实是AI的下一个阶段。

1418
02:12:51,460 --> 02:13:01,460
This is where we make AI, give the AI the opportunity with all the tools and all the capabilities to really bring meaningful real-world impact.
这里我们将打造AI，赋予AI所有工具和能力，真正实现有意义的现实世界影响。

1419
02:13:01,680 --> 02:13:07,900
And I can tell you I could not be more excited to build all of that together with you, our ecosystem.
我可以告诉你们，能与你们——我们的生态系统——共同构建这一切，我感到无比激动。

1420
02:13:08,500 --> 02:13:10,260
Thank you so much for joining us today.
非常感谢大家今天加入我们。
